  (text "CX7 with RX14: 4.82 Hz" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 121.92 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "aca4e08b-587a-55b1-9020-cf69ccad04f9"))
  (text "Section 4 of the circuit notes, stage 6. UX6 with RX12, RX13: the second gain stage, gain 4 (g2, chosen). The series' module\nis reported to clip with 3.3 V zeners in this stage's feedback [3]; on a 9 V supply the rails clip first (inferred, open question\n2),\nso UX6 clips at its rails. DX5, RX15, CX8, RX16: a peak detector that charges on hard notes (20 ms) and recovers (150 ms);\nRVX6, a gang of the Character pot that is at 0 up to noon, feeds a share of it to the + input through RX17, moving the\nstage off centre (bloomMax, chosen, the design notes' departure). CX7, RX14: the 5 Hz DC block after the clipping." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9c361575-4141-529b-9c2c-74b3c57bc4f5"))
